hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1074","Chapter on the stern warning against abandoning campaigning, 1112 - al-Rabi' ibn Sulayman narrated to us, he said: Asad, meaning Ibn Musa, narrated to us, he said: Abd Allah ibn Raja' narrated to us, from Umar ibn Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir, from Sumayy, from Abu Salih, from Abu Hurayrah (may Allah be pleased with him), who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever dies without having campaigned, with no resolve to do so in himself, dies upon a branch of hypocrisy."
